/T (manufacturing expenses, adhere to regulatory requirements, and maintain a constant level of product quality. The efficiency and productivity of kojic acid synthesis could be improved by applying new biotechnology techniques, such as manipulating genes and optimizing metabolic pathways. There are a variety of resources available to help small businesses overcome these obstacles, including financial backing, technical support, connections with academic institutions, and other strategies. In conclusion, kojic acid's adaptability in several applications, rising market demand, and cheap production costs make small-scale manufacture of the compound an attractive and profitable possibility. Prioritizing process optimization, cost management, and quality control can help small-scale enterprises maximize their output of kojic acid. )
