/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 62 0 R
/T (fungal strains and better fermentation processes, could increase kojic acid yield while decreasing production costs. To ensure the safe and efficient use of kojic acid in food, new food formulations and delivery technologies should be developed to address sensitivity concerns. Increasing use of kojic acid across a variety of food categories suggests that it has significant future prospects in the food business. Kojic acid has the potential to greatly improve food safety, quality, and shelf life, especially given the growing demand from consumers for environmentally friendly and natural food additives. To maximize kojic acid's potential in the food sector, researchers, producers, and regulatory bodies must work together effectively. )
/E (fungal strains and better fermentation processes, could increase kojic acid yield while decreasing production costs. To ensure the safe and efficient use of kojic acid in food, new food formulations and delivery technologies should be developed to address sensitivity concerns. Increasing use of kojic acid across a variety of food categories suggests that it has significant future prospects in the food business. Kojic acid has the potential to greatly improve food safety, quality, and shelf life, especially given the growing demand from consumers for environmentally friendly and natural food additives. To maximize kojic acid's potential in the food sector, researchers, producers, and regulatory bodies must work together effectively. )
